# Velora form conventions

- Reuse the shared Input, Label, Textarea, and Button components already used in `src/components/template/contact-form.tsx`.
- Use existing semantic color tokens and spacing patterns; avoid new hard-coded colors.
- Associate helper text with its input using a stable id and `aria-describedby`.
- Preserve native required/email validation and the frontend-only demo disclosure unless the task explicitly changes them.
